UID:pcori-substance-use-due-20260909@more-grant-radar
DTSTAMP:20260901T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260909
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] PCORI — Addressing Substance Use (Cycle 3 2026) — due
DESCRIPTION:The cleanest research fit we've found: a head-to-head trial of MORE vs CBT (or MORE + usual care/MOUD) for opioid use disorder is exactly what this funds — and for-profits can apply directly. Opened today\; the LOI gate is Sep 9.\n\nPath: Direct · Priority 25.2\nhttps://www.pcori.org/funding-opportunities/announcement/addressing-substance-use-pcori-funding-announcement-cycle-3-2026
URL:https://www.pcori.org/funding-opportunities/announcement/addressing-substance-use-pcori-funding-announcement-cycle-3-2026
