DESCRIPTION:Same post-award play as SM-26-014\, not the Aug 17 deadline. 117 existing CCBHCs are applying for $1M/yr improvement money — reach the funded cohort directly after the ~Nov 15 award list as their Section C EBP and Section B workforce-training partner\; pre-name MORE now only with clinics we already know are applying.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 21.2\nhttps://www.samhsa.gov/grants/grant-announcements/sm-26-015
